 ## Background
-The method was introduced to address the limitations of classic multi-level array grids (high memory) and one-level hashed grids (slow traversal) [S1, S2, unofficial]. It builds on row displacement compression (Lagae and Dutre, 2008) and multi-level macrocells (Wald et al., 2006) [S1, S2, unofficial]. It is used in interactive ray tracing of large scanned models [S1, unofficial] and in neural implicit surface reconstruction (Neuralangelo) [S3, unofficial] and dynamic volumetric video representation [S4, unofficial].
